  "details": "I have not seen this idea suggested elsewhere but it is something useful.\n\nConnecting two worlds by portals is a more immersive experience than using your menu as you just walk through the portal rather than search then drop a portal and walk through.\n\nOne issue though is when you leave a world its hard to go back unless its public or you know someone in the instance.\n\nSo I suggest adding a portal component that is liked to spawn and when someone spawns a local portal back to there last world and last instance of that world is created.\n\nIt of course has current/max players in case other people join when you leave but other than that it acts like a normal portal just local to you as to not let other people enter your last world and instance of that world.\n\nAnything to make traveling between worlds easier is good.",
